From 0445bab7590a79dde28a121e6c84ae140ceb0088 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viktor Semenov <suit.uanic@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:29:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 20/45] Send the stance, formation, command and upgrade state
 in the Specula feed

The remaining session panels read state the feed did not carry. Kind 12
gains group 8388608 (UnitAI.GetSelectableStances), 16777216 (the
formation template the entity is in and GetFormationsList), 33554432
(command flags: work orders, can guard, guarding, can patrol, gate
locked, packed, sharable and shared dropsite, ejectable turret, with
AlertRaiser's target classes and a TurretHolder's ejectable occupants)
and 67108864 (a kind 17 list of Upgrade.GetUpgrades, each read for the
owner with its own costs and requirements and the target's limits).
Kind 21 sends each player's formations and Barter.GetPrices with the
economy, kind 22 a formation's GetFormationInfoFromTemplate and
RequiredMemberCount. Kind 11 flags Identity's Undeletable, and Gate,
AlertRaiser, ResourceDropsite, TurretHolder and Market join the
component bits. New kinds and group bits, so the feed stays v14.
